    {
      "id": "0kM1NEwXuv1BCu9-FzcWZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 107.89987182617188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#b45309",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 696131181,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190993428,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What holds",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What holds",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MI4RIC578fBj1BLNbQnzu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 745,
      "width": 886.1522216796875,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1271597795,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190993428,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Tenant comes from the route; subject and plan from the verified credential, never from the body",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Tenant comes from the route; subject and plan from the verified credential, never from the body",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W1BNszxR-v7I-oC_Tbqe2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 777,
      "width": 858.3604125976562,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1919535309,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190993428,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. A device signs the exact bytes of the body and its purchase; a replay or an edit is refused",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. A device signs the exact bytes of the body and its purchase; a replay or an edit is refused",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7I2SDWjAv1jJfNktPqAJ4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 809,
      "width": 902.9280395507812,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 411940483,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190993428,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Pool and messages are reserved before the model call: failures refund, timeouts keep the reserve",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Pool and messages are reserved before the model call: failures refund, timeouts keep the reserve",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fQymJGFW1Abp5NWiVP3jV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 841,
      "width": 879.0422973632812,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1227958061,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190993428,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Three limits: messages per subject by plan, a monthly pool per tenant, per network if anonymous",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Three limits: messages per subject by plan, a monthly pool per tenant, per network if anonymous",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yGfaHTeLxu2wkAfVxNUdR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 873,
      "width": 767.10107421875,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2067394083,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190993429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Metrics and logs hold codes and measurements, never what was asked or answered",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Metrics and logs hold codes and measurements, never what was asked or answered",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "note6turns0000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 905,
      "width": 767.10107421875,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2067394100,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190993429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. A stored session runs one turn at a time; a turn retried with its Idempotency-Key is answered once",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. A stored session runs one turn at a time; a turn retried with its Idempotency-Key is answered once",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "note7stream000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 937,
      "width": 767.10107421875,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2067394117,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795190993429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7. A stream always ends on one event and closes; a client that leaves cancels the model call",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. A stream always ends on one event and closes; a client that leaves cancels the model call",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
